OL,5,G1855 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FDerek and Lynne Love are all about
OL,7,     Fkeeping it simple at the Langmead
OL,8,     FGuest House in Ramsgate. But
OL,9,     FCharlotte and Lucy are mortified
OL,10,     Fto find moths in the bed.
OL,11,G1925 Four in a Bed
